WEBVTT

00:12:59.149 --> 00:13:02.653
And to this day, when I feel the opposite,

00:13:02.653 --> 00:13:06.198
I can close my eyes
and feel that connection.

00:13:06.782 --> 00:13:09.368
And it carries me through the dark days.

00:13:09.743 --> 00:13:10.911
Thank you.

00:13:10.953 --> 00:13:16.500
(Applause)